XXRI OS Lite - Corresponding Source

This directory is published next to the ISO (boot/grub/SOURCE.txt on the ISO
points here).

* xxri-<version>-src.tar.xz - XXRI's own programs (src/), the files XXRI adds
  to the system (ptxdist/projectroot/), and the complete PTXdist build project
  that produced the ISO: rules, patches, configuration, scripts.  Build with
  `cd ptxdist && ptxdist images` (see ptxdist/README.md).
* The other archives - the upstream sources of every package the build
  compiles and ships, exactly as fetched and checksum-verified by the build:
  GRUB 2.14 (with its GPG signature), Qt 5.15.17 with Qt WebEngine, XLibre
  and its drivers, libfm, menu-cache, libexif, flwm, libglvnd, Mesa (the
  shared glapi).  Their patches are in the project archive under
  ptxdist/patches/.
* SHA256SUMS - checksums of this directory.

Tiny Core Linux 16.0 components (the kernel, core.gz's base system and the
extensions in cde/optional that are not named xxri-*) are redistributed
unmodified; their sources are published by Tiny Core at
  http://repo.tinycorelinux.net/16.x/x86/release/src/
  http://repo.tinycorelinux.net/16.x/x86/tcz/src/
